  <steps>
    <step order="1">Read `notes/w5-ai-coordination.md` + `SPAARKE-PLAYBOOK-LLM-OUTPUT-PATTERN.md` + `BUILD-A-NEW-NARRATIVE-OUTPUT-CONSUMER.md` to lock the authoring pattern + the DeliverComposite delivery.</step>
    <step order="2">Run `/conflict-check` scoped to `Services/Ai/`.</step>
    <step order="3">Read task 031's rung-5 extract/classify Action to reuse its classification output as the Triage Action's input (category/urgency) rather than re-deriving.</step>
    <step order="4">Author the "Communication Triage" JPS Action via `jps-action-create`: structured output fields category, urgency, obligations[], suggested actions[], response checklist; scopes + template params + examples. Map each output field to a DeliverComposite section name (ADR-037).</step>
    <step order="5">Wire delivery through `DeliverComposite` per the two-layer pattern (Layer 1 orchestrator template + Layer 2 `## Input`); consume the gate-050 seam for the composite executor.</step>
    <step order="6">Ensure it runs via `AppOnlyAnalysisService` (app-only/MI) with ADR-016 budget + ADR-014 cache; confirm it emits `Suggested`/`Ambiguous` only and never auto-files.</step>
    <step order="7">Validate the Action JSON with `jps-validate` (schema + render). Fix any validation errors.</step>
    <step order="8">Run `dotnet build` (if C# executor/registration touched); `dotnet publish -c Release ... -o deploy/api-publish/` (report size + delta vs ~49.63 MB) + `dotnet list package --vulnerable --include-transitive` (no new HIGH CVE).</step>
    <step order="9.5">FULL-rigor quality gates: `code-review` on the diff; `adr-check` against `spec.md` (ADR-037/013/016/014; never-auto-file). Address Critical findings. `/conflict-check` clean before PR.</step>
    <step order="10">Update `tasks/TASK-INDEX.md`: mark 053 ✅; confirm 054 unblocked. Update `current-task.md` (record Action name + section-name map + reuse of 031; advance).</step>
  </steps>

